  message: "CLOSE CONDITION MET. (1) The count at the switch: campaign 5 (bar/campaign5_summary.txt): 42 runs that failed a test, 35 narrowed, 0 failed tests outside the selection that fail alone with the fault (278 order-dependent from one test-only cleanup fault; gap filed WI-kihah). 0/42 bounds the per-run miss rate below about 7% (95%), not at zero. (2) The switch merged: PR #2260 (dev 61b03763f). (3) Live selected run under the new default, dev 3852addf6, one equivalent edit in graph_select.mentions on a throwaway branch, plain 'scripts/smart-test': stored graph 30; 100 test files; 'by-statement: left out 12 of the 19 indexed test(s) it could judge, in 1 file(s); 2 kept to cover the changed files (0.3 s)'; 2,559 passed, 4 skipped; coverage gate 100%; 251 s to the end of the tests (tests 242 s), 4m28s wall. The saving there is small: 34 of the 100 files were the read-record union's, which run whole. Pre-merge e2e on limits.py: 2,554 ran, 1,581 left out. The CI manifest still lists files (WI-kunah next)."  # 5062
